WAP in C to subtract  2 numbers, take input from the user.

File Extension:
.c : C language (v Imp)
.txt : notepad
.cc : CPP
.cpp : cpp
.cs : csharp
.java : Java
.o : object
.exe : executable


file.c Compile file.o interpret file.exe

file.c -> Debug -> file.exe


%d  -> int
%f -> float
%c -> char






